{{!
    @template local_a11y/face_cursor

    Face Navigation's virtual cursor: a dot with a dwell-progress ring
    around it. The ring's stroke-dashoffset is updated per frame directly
    via the DOM API (amd/src/face_navigation.js's setDwellProgress()), not
    through this template - re-rendering per frame would be far too slow
    for an animation loop, so only the static shell lives here.

    @description Markup for Face Navigation's virtual cursor (dot + dwell ring).
    @package    Moodle
    @subpackage Plugin a11y
    @author     Rodrigo Padilha Silveira <padilhars@gmail.com>
    @author     Jerônimo Medina Madruga <jeronimo.madruga@gmail.com>
    @copyright  Universidade Federal de Pelotas - UFPel
    @license    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later
    @version    0.1.0
    @since      0.1.0

    Context variables required for this template:
    * size - cursor box size in pixels (width/height of the SVG)
    * radius - the dwell ring's radius in pixels
    * circumference - the dwell ring's circumference in pixels (2*pi*radius),
      used as the ring's full stroke-dasharray/stroke-dashoffset

    Example context (json):
    {
        "size": 40,
        "radius": 18,
        "circumference": 113.1
    }
}}
<svg width="{{size}}" height="{{size}}" viewBox="0 0 {{size}} {{size}}"
    style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;transform:rotate(-90deg)" aria-hidden="true">
    <circle cx="{{halfsize}}" cy="{{halfsize}}" r="{{radius}}"
        fill="none" stroke="#3b82f6" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-dasharray="{{circumference}}" stroke-dashoffset="{{circumference}}"/>
</svg>
<div style="position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:14px;height:14px;
    border-radius:50%;background:#3b82f6;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px white,0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.5)"></div>
